  "changes": [
    "Use standalone public Material/Cupertino UI packages for widgets, themes, and localizations.",
    "Declare required UI dependencies and Flutter >=3.47.0; retain upstream Dart language and platform contracts.",
    "Keep this repository-local compatibility fork unpublished (publish_to: none).",
    "Update documentation examples in lib/src/utils/phone_number.dart and lib/src/widgets/input_widget.dart from raw print to debugPrint; no executable code changes.",
    "Resolve strict JSON typing with explicit nullable string and map conversions, typed country collections, and typed ISO-prefix results; preserve country data and valid-input parsing behavior.",
    "Rename enum values and public helper constants to lowerCamelCase (see local_api_renames). Preserve enum order/index and numeric value mapping, country field names, and widget-key string payloads; enum name/toString spelling changes with the identifiers.",
    "Use unnamed library directives, final private bindings, immutable const constructors, super parameters, and a public State<CountrySearchListWidget> return type. Reuse the inherited WidgetView.state field rather than shadowing it.",
    "Remove two layout-neutral Container wrappers and use SizedBox for the width-only country-dialog wrapper; retain children, constraints, styles, event callbacks, and lifecycle behavior.",
    "Remove unnecessary this/new qualifiers and simplify equivalent string interpolation. Retain qualifiers where local country/countries parameters shadow state fields.",
    "Update the only first-party enum caller, lib/component/ui/phone_input_mobile.dart, from PhoneInputSelectorType.DIALOG to PhoneInputSelectorType.dialog. Existing test key strings remain unchanged.",
    "Keep key parameters on public widgets; omit unused private-widget key parameters."
  ],
